ctors relate to the Glass Menagerie Haunters who are working on a similar project...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2317-callishka","name":"Callishka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2317_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"264"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-24T19:37:52-08:00","id":1189331,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Callishka</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/1189281-tinkering-with-some-proctor-initiate-arts?p=1189310#post1189310\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder how these Proctors relate to the Glass Menagerie Haunters who are working on a similar project...</div> </div> </div> </div>You know how fear the Germans would build a nuke (however unrealistic that possibility was based on modern historic knowledge) motivated US efforts to beat them to the punch?<br /> <br /> That\u2019s more or less the relationship. The Proctor sect working to lift the Fog want to cultivate good relationships with the living, reunite lovers and families, etc etc. The Haunters getting to define the lasting relationship between the living and the dead is their nightmare scenario!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>